Compared to Figure~\ref{acc_acc_score}, the results presented in Figures~\ref{fig:ch_acc_score_2} and \ref{fig:ch_acc_score_1} represent higher accuracy when the model has been trained with samples spanning the complete range of accumulation scores (and \glspl{cu}).
