For H1 and H2, we also measured additional outcomes in the form of subjective assessments collected through a post-discussion survey. Participants rated the range of viewpoints in the discussion and how often they encountered new arguments (H1). They also evaluated the extent to which they felt that individuals from different backgrounds were engaged in the discussion, and whether all participants had a balanced opportunity to contribute (H2). The results for these additional outcomes are shown in figure S1 in the supplementary material.

