Tab.~\ref{tab:mallotane-speedups} lists the speedups of \mallotane{} over \lilotane{} and Fig.~\ref{fig:mallotane-scatter} shows a visual comparison of individual running times.
As expected, our setup incurs some overhead compared to a sequential SAT solver that is compiled into the planning application.
This overhead, however, proves to be small and mostly concerns easy problems which are resolved in less than a second.
