\section{Conclusion}
In this paper, we proposed MRGAgents, a novel multi-agent framework based on Med-LVLMs, designed to enhance the accuracy and clinical relevancy of automated medical report generation. By employing task-specific agents that are fine-tuned on disease-centric data, our framework ensures the generation of more detailed and clinically valuable reports. Experiment on IU X-ray and MIMIC-CXR datasets demonstrated that our MRGAgents outperformed existing single-LVLM methods.

