All initial conditions of nodes (i.e., $x_i(0)$) are selected from the interval $[-1,1]$.
Moreover, all edge weights are initially set to 1 for the proposed method if there exists an edge between nodes $i$ and $j$.
The parameters for dynamics in (\ref{aij_dynamics}) and (\ref{thetaij_dynamics}) are set as $\zeta_1=500$, $\zeta_2=500$, respectively.
In addition, $\psi =500$, $\overline{{\gamma}_{ij}}=1$, and $\underline{{\gamma}_{ij}}=0.3$ are selected\footnote{The parameters can be selected as $\underline{{\gamma}_{ij}}\in [0.2,0.4]$ and $\overline{{\gamma}_{ij}}=1$.} for (\ref{gamma_update_rule}).
