    % The independent variable \textit{ave\_distance} between a pair of mentee and mentor is the average length of the shortest path linking their papers within the co-citation networks.
    Note that the coefficients (grey nodes) for \textit{colla\_work\_count} are derived from Models 7 presented in \textcolor{cyan}{Supplementary Table S6-S8}. The statistical significance of the variables is presented at the left of each value (* p < 0.05; **p < 0.01; ***p < 0.001).
    }
