\subsection{Data Sets}
The performance analysis and comparison of CA-QNN model is conducted using 
four different benchmark datasets including \textit{Cluster workloads}: CPU and memory usage traces from  Google Cluster Data (GCD) \cite{Reiss2011} and \textit{Alibaba  Cluster  traces} (ACT) obtained from \cite{9068614}. 
